note s_break: leave the innermost loop: find the nearest block of kind 3 (while) or 4 (for), emit an
note always-taken B.cond to the loop's exit and record the word for s_end to patch. Outside a loop the
note line is error 9. Like ret, the line ends the path (a later line in the same block is error 17).
fn s_break to void
